# bas-guard

The unscoped name of **BAS Guard**, a local, read-only security scanner for Claude Code skills,
hooks, MCP servers and plugins. This package installs nothing of its own: it runs
[`__NAME__`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/__NAME__) at the same version.

```bash
npx bas-guard check ./some-skill
npm i -g __NAME__          # the full install: puts `bas-guard` on your PATH
```

Source, documentation and releases: <https://github.com/basdotio/bas-guard>
